---
+ Always use Boostrap5 before custom CSS if possible
+ Put any needed CSS in a well organized CSS file
+ never put CSS styles inline in HTML when it can be avoided, always use the theme CSS file and provide a local CSS to override and add to the theme CSS
+ Disable caching of CSS and JS in development
+ modify [start.sh](mdc:start.sh) as needed to support easy start with different options like logging
+ avoid and eradicate development artifacts that lead to duplication and noise. Seek files to remove based on refactoring
+ use partials to enable smaller template files
+ use theme 'simple'